g><br>You will be able to view a &quot;Data Hacked&quot; page, which will show you the data<i>(score)</i> required to unlock the image. Each threat you destroy will give you a different amount of data, the more data you retrieve, the more images you gain access to, of increasingly mature content. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151840/extras/6d94df6591f455fdb5c3d09f1f1cf35c.avif?t=1606457929\" /></div><br><br><strong>Power ups</strong><br>You can achieve hack combo's and collect &quot;hack tokens&quot; <i>(power ups)</i> as you progress. The difficulty will increase over time, so these are essential if you want to access all the gallery content and achievements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151840/extras/eb5a4bcefcbfb9a96dfc1e9af8ee41fd.avif?t=1606457929\" /></div><br><br>You programmed audio responses into Sir'HaXXX too, so you will enjoy some &quot;quality responses&quot; upon destroying threats.<br><br>**<i>Character Artwork By LoverNios</i>**",
